### Open this file in IntelliJ and click the green arrow next to each request.

### 1. Add an application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "LTIMindtree",
  "role": "Graduate Engineer Trainee",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "source": "Campus",
  "appliedOn": "2026-10-04",
  "interviewDate": "2026-11-05",
  "notes": "Online test on 4 Oct"
}

### 2. List everything
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### 3. Filter by stage
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications?status=APPLIED

### 4. Search company or role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/search?q=mindtree

### 5. Counts per stage
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/stats

### 6. One application
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

### 7. Legal move: APPLIED to ASSESSMENT  (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ASSESSMENT" }

### 8. Illegal move: skipping a stage  (409 Conflict)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OFFER" }

### 9. Validation failure  (400 with fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "", "role": "SDE" }

### 10. Missing id  (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/9999

### 11. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1
